(16882: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20Output%20and%20aborts%20as%20values%2C%20for%20the%20targets%20whose%20programs%20are%20pure.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Rust%20and%20JavaScript%20print%20where%20the%20source%20prints%20and%20abort%20where%20it%0A%2F%2F%21%20aborts%3B%20in%20Lean%20and%20Rocq%20a%20function%20that%20prints%20or%20may%20abort%2C%20directly%20or%0A%2F%2F%21%20through%20a%20function%20it%20calls%2C%20takes%20the%20lines%20printed%20before%20it%20and%20returns%0A%2F%2F%21%20them%2C%20with%20the%20lines%20it%20prints%20added%20in%20front%2C%20paired%20with%20its%20value%2C%20or%2C%0A%2F%2F%21%20when%20it%20aborts%2C%20with%20the%20source%27s%20abort%20message%20instead%20of%20a%20value%3B%20main%0A%2F%2F%21%20prints%20the%20lines%20each%20of%20its%20steps%20adds%20and%20stops%20with%20the%20message%20of%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20first%20abort.%20The%20rewriting%20is%20target-independent%3A%20it%20yields%20a%20portable-core%0A%2F%2F%21%20program%20without%20%60print%60%20and%20%60abort%60%20nodes%2C%20machine-integer%20arithmetic%20or%0A%2F%2F%21%20checked%20conversions%2C%20whose%20pairs%20are%20generated%20data%20types.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Foutput.js%60.%0A%0Amod%20callables%3B%0Amod%20evaluation%3B%0A%0Ause%20std%3A%3Aborrow%3A%3ACow%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3AHashSet%3B%0A%0Amod%20settle%3B%0A%0Ause%20super%3A%3ASpan%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Aaborts%3A%3A%7Bcast_message%2C%20overflow_message%2C%20zero_divisor_message%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Adiagnostics%3A%3A%7BResult%2C%20unsupported%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Air%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20Case%2C%20Comparison%2C%20Ctor%2C%20DataDecl%2C%20Decl%2C%20Effect%2C%20Expr%2C%20Field%2C%20FnDecl%2C%20LitValue%2C%20Main%2C%20Node%2C%0A%20%20%20%20Param%2C%20Pattern%2C%20Program%2C%20Prop%2C%20TheoremDecl%2C%0A%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Asurface%3A%3ABinaryOp%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Atypes%3A%3A%7BBOOL%2C%20INT%2C%20NAT%2C%20STRING%2C%20Type%2C%20data%7D%3B%0Ause%20settle%3A%3A%7Baborts%2C%20division%2C%20fixed_max%2C%20fixed_min%2C%20representation%2C%20settle_program%2C%20total%7D%3B%0A%2F%2F%2F%20A%20step%20of%20main%20is%20a%20%60print%60%20effect%20itself%3B%20what%20threads%20is%20a%20value%20that%20prints%20or%20may%20abort.%0Afn%20effect_operand_any%28effect%3A%20%26Effect%2C%20test%3A%20%26dyn%20Fn%28%26Expr%29%20-%3E%20bool%29%20-%3E%20bool%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20match%20effect%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Effect%3A%3ALet%20%7B%20value%2C%20..%20%7D%20%3D%3E%20test%28value%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Effect%3A%3AAssert%20%7B%20prop%2C%20..%20%7D%20%3D%3E%20prop_any%28prop%2C%20test%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Effect%3A%3APrint%20%7B%20expr%2C%20..%20%7D%20%7C%20Effect%3A%3AOutput%20%7B%20expr%2C%20..%20%7D%20%3D%3E%20test%28expr%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Effect%3A%3AUnwrap%20%7B%20pair%2C%20..%20%7D%20%3D%3E%20test%28pair%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20The%20checked%20program%20with%20its%20output%20and%20aborts%20threaded%20through%2C%20or%20the%0A%2F%2F%2F%20program%20itself%20when%20nothing%20below%20main%20prints%20or%20aborts.%0A%2F%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%2F%20%23%20Errors%0A%2F%2F%2F%20When%20an%20operand%20that%20prints%20or%20aborts%20sits%20in%20a%20compound%20assertion%2C%20or%20a%0A%2F%2F%2F%20theorem%20states%20a%20fact%20of%20a%20computation%20that%20may%20abort.%0Apub%20fn%20thread_output%28source%3A%20%26Program%29%20-%3E%20Result%3CCow%3C%27_%2C%20Program%3E%3E%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20thread_output_for_target%28source%2C%20%22Lean%22%29%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20Thread%20output%20using%20the%20selected%20pure%20target%27s%20shared%20callable%20boundary.%0A%2F%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%2F%20%23%20Errors%0A%2F%2F%2F%20On%20an%20effectful%20callable%20type%20or%20an%20existing%20output%20sequencing%20obligation.%0Apub%20fn%20thread_output_for_target%3C%27a%3E%28source%3A%20%26%27a%20Program%2C%20target%3A%20%26str%29%20-%3E%20Result%3CCow%3C%27a%2C%20Program%3E%3E%20%7B%